  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x equals 8 a left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>\n<p>The given equation relates the positive numbers <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
