      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"a equals StartFraction x Over 8 EndFraction minus left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
