  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. To express <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math>, the given equation can be rewritten such that <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> is isolated on one side of the equation. Since it&rsquo;s given that <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math> is a positive number, <math alttext=\"b plus 9\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>b</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> is not equal to zero. Therefore, dividing both sides of the given equation by <math alttext=\"8 left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis\"><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;yields the equivalent equation <math alttext=\"StartFraction x Over 8 left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis EndFraction equals a\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"a equals StartFraction x Over 8 left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis EndFraction\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"x equals 8 left parenthesis a plus left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis right parenthesis\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"x equals StartFraction 8 left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis Over a EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"x equals StartFraction a Over 8 left parenthesis b plus 9 right parenthesis EndFraction\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p>",
